---
title: Sale Barn
layout: 'base.njk'
description: Browse the Sale Barn, the livestock currently listed by Smoky Mountain Acres. Contact the farm to confirm availability, pricing, and pickup details.
permalink: /from-the-farm/livestock-inventory/
---

<section class="team section paper-texture">
  <div class="container section-title pb-3" data-aos="fade-up">
    <div class="section-title-row">
      <img class="text-decoration-left" src="/assets/img/Smoky Mountain Acres/text-decoration-half-leaf.webp" alt="">
      <h1 class="h2 mb-0">Sale Barn</h1>
      <img class="text-decoration-right" src="/assets/img/Smoky Mountain Acres/text-decoration-half-leaf.webp" alt="">
    </div>
    <p>Browse the piglets currently listed by our farm. Availability can change, so contact us to confirm details.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="row gy-4">
      {% for animal in livestock %}
        <div class="col-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="{{ (loop.index0 % 4) * 50 }}">
          <article class="team h-100">
            {% if animal.image %}
            <div class="pic">
              <img src="{{ animal.image }}" alt="{{ animal.name }}{% if animal.sex or animal.animal_type %}, a {{ animal.sex | lower }} {{ animal.animal_type | lower }}{% endif %} at Smoky Mountain Acres" class="img-fluid" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.pic').hidden=true">
              {% if animal.sold %}<span class="status-stamp status-stamp-sold">SOLD</span>{% elif animal.pending %}<span class="status-stamp status-stamp-pending">PENDING</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            <h3>{{ animal.name }}</h3>
            <p>
              {% if animal.breed %}{{ animal.breed }}<br>{% endif %}
              {% if animal.sex %}Gender: {{ animal.sex }}<br>{% endif %}
              {% if animal.birth_date %}Approx. DOB: {{ animal.birth_date }}<br>{% endif %}
              {% if animal.price %}Price: {{ animal.price }}<br>{% endif %}
              {% if animal.description %}{{ animal.description }}{% endif %}
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container text-center mt-5" data-aos="fade-up">
    <p>Ask us about current availability, pricing, and pickup arrangements.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="cta-btn">Contact the Farm</a>
  </div>
</section>